{"agent_attempt":0,"best":"import Std\n\n-- BEGIN VERISLOP REGISTRY\n-- Generated by `verislop formalize`. Typed obligation metadata: an index, never evidence.\nnamespace VeriSlop.Registry\n\nstructure SourceRef where\n  documentRef : String\n  documentHash : String\n  startByte : Nat\n  endByte : Nat\n  origin : String\n  interpretation : String\n\nstructure Dependency where\n  id : String\n  relation : String\n\nstructure Entry where\n  id : String\n  revision : Nat\n  kind : String\n  role : String\n  statement : String\n  required : Bool\n  sourceRefs : List SourceRef\n  scope : List String\n  dependencies : List Dependency\n  acceptanceCriteria : List String\n  bindings : List String\n\ndef «D1» : Entry := {\n  id := \"D1\",\n  revision := 1,\n  kind := \"entity\",\n  role := \"declaration\",\n  statement := \"Deliver a pure VSCore 0.3 source implementation. Compass has exactly north, south and center. Packet has direction:Compass and amount:Int. The adjust entry returns a Packet preserving direction, adding two to amount when direction is north and subtracting three otherwise. The domain contains every Compass alternative and every mathematical integer; a Packet with north and zero is a witness. Deliver adjust in program.vscore.json with typed total evaluation, deterministic results, preserved inputs, no external I/O or floating point, pure data and the restricted runtime. These source requirements are independently required and are also part of the value guarantee. This is a restricted source contract.\",\n  required := true,\n  sourceRefs := [{ documentRef := \"request.txt\", documentHash := \"sha256:0afb0b9c8d2d86505637536ad22c2c3d2d117ca40b676d104bdcc2b42a97cb1c\", startByte := 0, endByte := 707, origin := \"explicit\", interpretation := \"the generic enum Packet source contract\" }],\n  scope := [\"every nominal Compass alternative and every mathematical integer\"],\n  dependencies := [],\n  acceptanceCriteria := [\"exact accepted nominal types, universal